---
import '../styles/site.css';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  noIndex?: boolean;
}

const { title, description, noIndex = false } = Astro.props;
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, 'https://moving.emfls.com').toString();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
    {noIndex && <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />}
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="EMFLS Moving" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">본문 바로가기</a>
    <div class="site-shell">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="EMFLS Moving 홈">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">EMFLS</span>
          <span class="brand-name">Moving<span class="brand-period">.</span></span>
        </a>
        <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="주 메뉴">
          <a href="/#timeline">이사 타임라인</a>
          <a href="/about/">사이트 소개</a>
          <a href="/contact/">문의</a>
        </nav>
        <a class="header-action" href="/#timeline">준비 순서 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </header>

      <main id="main-content">
        <slot />
      </main>

      <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="footer-intro">
          <a class="footer-brand" href="/">EMFLS Moving<span class="brand-period">.</span></a>
          <p>이사 날짜부터 첫 주까지, 다음 준비를 차근히 정리합니다.</p>
        </div>
        <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="사이트 정책 및 정보">
          <a href="/about/">소개</a>
          <a href="/editorial-policy/">콘텐츠 기준</a>
          <a href="/privacy/">개인정보</a>
          <a href="/contact/">문의</a>
        </nav>
        <p class="footer-note">정보는 일반적인 준비 참고용입니다. 계약·법률 판단과 신청 기한은 해당 기관에 확인하세요.</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
